<title>HONG KONG: Henderson Inv interim net down 33 pct.</title>
<headline>Henderson Inv interim net down 33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   31.9  vs  52.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    13.0  vs  13.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	   nil  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			  898.21  vs  1,337.70</p>
<p>    Turnover		   726.03  vs  1,581.87</p>
<p>    Company name		 Henderson Investment Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 22-28</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   April 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Henderson Investment, an investment holding and property development company, is 64.27 percent owned by Henderson Land Development Co Ltd.</p>
<p>It joined the blue-chip Hang Seng Index on August 30, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
